sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Viewer (browser)
    participant API as API service
    participant R as Redis

    V->>API: GET /api/v1/scoreboard
    API->>R: ZREVRANGE leaderboard 0 9 WITHSCORES
    API-->>V: 200 { top10, version }
    V->>API: GET /api/v1/scoreboard/stream (EventSource)
    API-->>V: SSE "scoreboard" (current snapshot)
    loop On every top-10 change
        API-->>V: SSE "scoreboard" {top10, version}
    end
    loop Every 15s
        API-->>V: SSE comment ": ping" (keeps proxies from closing the connection)
    end
